ng to and hurts you  so what happens if you use both of the  ruptured crystal tears you can find  it causes an even bigger explosion and  hurts you for even more of your health  curiosity did kill the cat indeed the  good news is you can use it on enemies  and it will hurt them for a good amount  as well so maybe it can be a viable  attack option if you want and there you  have 10 more things you may not have  known about eldon ring i hope you  learned at least one new thing here and  i love it if you shared in the comments  findings you guys made as i'm still  learning and discovering new aspects  about the game myself  and i'll see you guys next time peace
 

